Hi, did you miss me? I hope so. And I haven't forgotten about you and have prepared a New Year's update.

Update list:
 Added gift decorations;
 Added snowmen;
 Added snow;
 Added a New Year's hat for the main character;
 A little optimization (as best I could, sorry);
 Corrected decorations;
 Added Spanish language;
 Also, some bugs and some edits were fixed


Happy New Year to everyone!

