Hello, well, let's continue updating. I talked to you here and found something for myself, namely something that still needs to be updated. Thank you :)


List of changes:

 Updated textures of some SkibidiToilets (Now they look like Hitler);
 Added new achievements (good luck finding them);
 Boss now releases SkibidiToilets faster than before;
 Some location textures have been changed;
 Added some objects to level 1 locations;
 The main menu has been slightly changed;
 Added Hitler in a cage (Now after completing the game, you will free him);



Thanks everyone for the feedback and ideas for games :)


