Hi everyone, thanks to your feedback and recent communication, I've made some changes to the game. I hope you enjoy it

List of changes:

 Added a few more soundtracks;
 Added to the pause menu, a slider that adjusts the volume of the music;
 Changed the character's face;
 Changed the character's skirt;
 Slightly changed the main menu;
 Changed the appearance of some enemies;
